.5 py-0.5 bg-green-soft text-green\">БСП<!-- -->: <!-- -->за<!-- --> <span class=\"num opacity-70\">10/0/0</span></span><span class=\"text-xs rounded-sm px-1.5 py-0.5 bg-red text-white\">ИТН<!-- -->: <!-- -->против<!-- --> <span class=\"num opacity-70\">0/9/1</span></span><span class=\"text-xs rounded-sm px-1.5 py-0.5 bg-red text-white\">Независими<!-- -->: <!-- -->против<!-- --> <span class=\"num opacity-70\">0/1/0</span></span></p></li><li class=\"py-2\"><p><span class=\"text-sm text-muted num mr-2\">28.09.2023</span>ЗИД на Закона за защита на лицата, подаващи сигнали или публично оповестяващи информация за нарушения - първо гласуване<!-- --> <span class=\"inline-block text-xs font-semibold px-2 py-0.5 rounded-sm bg-green-soft text-green\">Прието</span></p><p class=\"flex flex-wrap gap-1 mt-1\"><span class=\"text-xs rounded-sm px-1.5 py-0.5 bg-green-soft text-green\">ГЕРБ-СДС<!-- -->: <!-- -->за<!-- --> <span class=\"num opacity-70\">47/1/3</span></span><span class=\"text-xs rounded-sm px-1.5 py-0.5 bg-green-soft text-green\">ПП-ДБ<!-- -->: <!-- -->за<!-- --> <span class=\"num opacity-70\">49/0/0</span></span><span class=\"text-xs rounded-sm px-1.5 py-0.5 bg-red text-white\">Възраждане<!-- -->: <!-- -->против<!-- --> <span class=\"num opacity-70\">0/28/0</span></span><span class=\"text-xs rounded-sm px-1.5 py-0.5 bg-green-soft text-green\">ДПС<!-- -->: <!-- -->за<!-- --> <span class=\"num opacity-70\">16/0/1</span></span><span class=\"text-xs rounded-sm px-1.5 py-0.5 bg-red text-white\">БСП<!-- -->: <!-- -->против<!-- --> <span class=\"num opacity-70\">0/14/0</span></span><span class=\"text-xs rounded-sm px-1.5 py-0.5 bg-red text-white\">ИТН<!-- -->: <!-- -->против<!-- --> <span class=\"num opacity-70\">0/9/0</span></span><span class=\"text-xs rounded-sm px-1.5 py-0.5 bg-red text-white\">Независими<!-- -->: <!-- -->против<!-- --> <span class=\"num opacity-70\">0/1/0</span></span></p></li><li class=\"py-2\"><p><span class=\"text-sm text-muted num mr-2\">28.09.2023<